# The parley (ADR 0014; docs/regions/strahd_presence.md): the engine plays strahd/final:parley before a final battle
# starts. Strahd names his price, and the answer is strahd_parley: fight (the battle begins), yield (the party kneels:
# Strahd triumphant) or ireena (she is given to him: the bride). Ireena is offered only while she travels with the
# party or he already holds her. Nothing here depends on one social check.

~ parley
appear strahd
cutscene strahd_waiting
Narrator: He is waiting for you, as he said he would be, hands folded behind his back like a host at the top of his own stair.
Strahd: My guests. You came. I did wonder whether you would, and I am so rarely made to wonder.
if item:sunsword
Strahd: And you carry my brother's blade. Sergei never could hold on to anything that mattered.
endif
if item:holy_symbol_of_ravenkind
Strahd: The old priests' sun. I remember the last man who carried it. I remember how he sounded at the end.
endif
if item:tome_of_strahd
Strahd: You have read my book. Then you know I was not always this. Do not pity me for it. I never pitied anyone.
endif
if flag.strahd_withdrew
Strahd: I have left a fight with you before. You may have taken it for weakness. It was manners.
endif
if flag.strahd_window == "fight"
Strahd: You bled me at her window. I have thought of it fondly since.
endif
if flag.heart_of_sorrow_shattered
Strahd: You broke my heart in the tower. A poet would make something of that. I will make something of you.
endif
if guest:ireena
Strahd: Ireena. You came home.
Ireena [angry]: I came to watch you die.
elif flag.ireena_held_by_strahd
Strahd: Ireena is upstairs, dressing for dinner. She asks after you. Less than she did.
endif
-> price

~ price
Strahd: Here is my price. I will name it once.
if guest:ireena or flag.ireena_held_by_strahd
Strahd: Leave Ireena with me, freely, and walk out of my house with your lives. The mists will even let you go. I can be generous when I am happy.
endif
Strahd: Or kneel, and serve me, and live a very long time. Or refuse, and we will finish this.
-> parley_menu

~ parley_menu
* We came to end you. -> fight
* [if guest:ireena or flag.ireena_held_by_strahd] Take her, then. Let us go. -> give_ireena
* We yield. -> yield
* [if flag.strahd_seen_trapped] You can't leave this valley either, can you? -> trapped
* [Insight DC 18] Look for the fear behind the courtesy. -> fear_seen | fear_missed

~ trapped
Strahd: The valley and I have an understanding. I keep it, and it keeps me. You would find the arrangement suits you less.
-> parley_menu

~ fear_seen
Narrator: There: at the thought of an ending, the smallest stillness in him, like a man hearing a step on the stair. He knows it could happen.
-> parley_menu

~ fear_missed
Narrator: Courtesy all the way down, as far as you can see. If there is a floor to it, he keeps it somewhere you can't reach.
-> parley_menu

~ fight
set strahd_parley = "fight"
approve godrick_pendlebrook +2 thistle +2 wren_featherfoot +1 liriel_dawnsong +1: You told Strahd you came to end him
-> answered

~ give_ireena
set strahd_parley = "ireena"
if guest:ireena
Ireena [afraid]: You're... no. You wouldn't. Not after all of it.
Ireena [sad]: Then I'll go. Not for him. For you, so you get out. Remember that I chose it.
endif
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: No. I won't stand here for that. Sir Pellam wouldn't have, and I won't.
approve godrick_pendlebrook -10 liriel_dawnsong -8 thistle -8 wren_featherfoot -8 kip_smudgewick -6 ratatoille -6: You offered Ireena to Strahd to buy your own way out
-> answered

~ yield
set strahd_parley = "yield"
approve godrick_pendlebrook -4 thistle -4 wren_featherfoot -3 liriel_dawnsong -3 kip_smudgewick -2 ratatoille -2: You yielded to Strahd in his own castle
-> answered

~ answered
if flag.strahd_parley == "fight"
Strahd [smile]: Good. I should have been so disappointed. Begin.
elif flag.strahd_parley == "yield"
Strahd: Kneel, then. There. You see how easy it is? Everyone kneels in the end. You have only done it sooner.
elif flag.strahd_parley == "ireena"
Strahd: Thank you. Truly. Now go, before I remember how much you have cost me.
endif
-> END
